Add a Blank Left Channel\

\b0 This converts a mono sound into a stereo sound, moving the mono information into the right channel of the new sound, and zeroing out the left channel of the new sound.\
\

\pard\tx520\tx1060\tx1600\tx2120\tx2660\tx3200\tx3720\tx4260\tx4800\tx5320\b\fc1\cf1 Add a Blank Right Channel\

\b0 This converts a mono sound into a stereo sound, moving the mono information into the left channel of the new sound, and zeroing out the right channel of the new sound.\
\

\pard\tx520\tx1060\tx1600\tx2120\tx2660\tx3200\tx3720\tx4260\tx4800\tx5320\b\fc1\cf1 Delete the Left Channel\

\b0 This converts a stereo sound into a mono sound by stripping out the left channel and moving the right channel into the mono sound. \
\

\b Delete the Right Channel\

\b0 This converts a stereo sound into a mono sound by stripping out the right channel and moving the left channel into the mono sound. \

\b \
Swap Channels\

\b0 This swaps the left and right channels of a stereo sound. \

